<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Kemayan stock up on requotation.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Kemayan stock up on requotation.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The stock of property firm Kemayan Corp Bhd rose 5.3 percent on requotation after a one-day suspension, dealers said.</p>
<p>About 20 minutes into trading, the stock was up 18 cents to 3.60 ringgit on volume of 40,000 shares.</p>
<p>Kemayan said on Friday it was selling its 60 percent stake in Kemayan Construction Sdn Bhd to net-maker Jaya Netting Industries Bhd for 72 million ringgit.</p>
<p>Kemayan said it would realise an extraordinary gain of 52 million ringgit from the sale.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-230 8911)</p>
